# Journal App

A REST API for personal journaling. Users can create an account, sign in to receive a JWT, and manage their own journal entries. The application stores users and entries in MongoDB, protects API routes with Spring Security, and includes supporting integrations for weather, Redis caching, email, and Kafka-based weekly sentiment notifications.

> This repository contains the backend API. It does not include a web or mobile client.

## Contents

- [Features](#features)
- [Technology stack](#technology-stack)
